    "detailed_description": "<br><br><strong>Enter the Warring States Era</strong><br>The God of War, Chiyou, has long been defeated, and the Yan-Huang alliance of humans came to dominate the lands. For over 1000 years, humans have co-existed and thrived with other races on the continent. Now, as the Zhou royal family is in decline, numerous powers are on the rise.Amidst this struggle for dominance, the era of the Warring States begins! Forces lurking in the shadows are stirring, and ancient beasts are poised for return. <br><br>How will you write your chapter in this grand epic?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/da1bdc0c9075a55c4ba58b948b970941.avif?t=1754123501\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/65f2d1e96ac7ecbe3d102b2118b9a2a6.poster.avif?t=1754123501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/65f2d1e96ac7ecbe3d102b2118b9a2a6.webm?t=1754123501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/65f2d1e96ac7ecbe3d102b2118b9a2a6.mp4?t=1754123501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/b55286f2dfa3ebb9f7ef240a95af2569.avif?t=1754123501\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/927be3f4b66d5e0eaf7997163d79b69c.poster.avif?t=1754123501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389170/extras/927be3f4b66d5e0eaf7997163d79b69c.webm?t=1754123501\" type=\"video/w